      "id": "claim_5de69cccac5a4dbaa04b36e39505f66d",
      "statement": "The repository has two layers: an engine of invocable skills/agents that do the work, and a thin risk/trust harness (feature-intake, hooks, rules, specs/<slug>/SUMMARY.md) that decides how much process a change needs and when to involve a human, governed by the principle that ceremony scales with risk and human interruption scales with ambiguity.",
